  | one_to_three : TwinTransition ⟨1, by decide⟩ ⟨3, by decide⟩
  | two_to_four : TwinTransition ⟨2, by decide⟩ ⟨4, by decide⟩
  | four_to_one : TwinTransition ⟨4, by decide⟩ ⟨1, by decide⟩

